<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups two casual food chains.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman ups two casual food chains.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded Quality Dining Inc and Boston Chicken Inc to trading buy from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Boston Chicken rose 1-5/8 to 37-1/2 and Quality Dining fell 1/8 to 19-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
